/**
 * PE-001 — Amazing Fun Park. Real venue record.
 *
 * Source: the PE-001 profile reviewed with the founder on Oct 23–24, 2026
 * (revision 3 of the Mississauga indoor playground review). Every fact below
 * comes from the venue's own website, FAQ and booking pages; the booking-page
 * prices were read from screenshots the founder supplied on Oct 24, 2026.
 *
 * This file is the single source for the PE-001 seed
 * (supabase/seeds/discover/pe-001-amazing-fun-park.sql, generated by
 * scripts/discover/build-venue-seed.ts). It is stored as a draft, and the seed
 * loads it as a draft. Publishing is a separate, explicit step
 * (supabase/seeds/discover/pe-001-amazing-fun-park.publish.sql).
 *
 * Conflicts on the venue's own pages, and how they are handled:
 * - AFP Unlimited: $99.95 on the chart and description, $99.99 on the booking
 *   button. Stored as $99.99 (the charged price) and marked conflicting.
 * - AFP Unlimited session: "All Day Play" vs "2-hour visits, one per day".
 *   The record says "one visit a day" and leaves the length out.
 * - The weekday ticket's fine print names Mondays (closed) and leaves out
 *   Wednesdays; not used.
 * - The 30-child party is on the parties page but not on the booking list;
 *   it is listed as "contact the venue".
 *
 * Not confirmed, so stored as no rows: parking, washrooms, change tables,
 * Adventure Camp details, Story Time, winter-break Monday–Tuesday opening.
 */

